{"id":"645927","name":"煲仔饭","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/645927/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"腊肠","amount":"1根"},{"name":"腊肉","amount":"1小块"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"2朵"},{"name":"青菜","amount":"2棵"},{"name":"大米","amount":"2人量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"小半匙"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"小半勺"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"糖","amount":"半匙"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"清水","amount":"3勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"腊肠、腊肉、青菜、香菇分别切好。","img":"images/645927/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"两颗土鸡蛋。","img":"images/645927/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用酱油、老抽、蚝油、糖、清水调一个酱汁。","img":"images/645927/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大米提前浸泡30分钟。","img":"images/645927/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备一口小锅，锅里刷油。","img":"images/645927/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盛入大米。","img":"images/645927/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"铺平。","img":"images/645927/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入盖过大米一厘米的清水。","img":"images/645927/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火烧开后转小火。","img":"images/645927/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖盖焖十分钟。","img":"images/645927/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"十分钟后开盖。","img":"images/645927/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"摆入腊肠、腊肉、香菇和鸡蛋，盖盖继续焖五分钟。","img":"images/645927/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"五分钟后开盖。","img":"images/645927/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"浇入酱汁，继续焖2分钟。","img":"images/645927/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"最后把烫熟的青菜拌入即可。","img":"images/645927/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"味道棒极了！","img":"images/645927/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"还有焦香的锅巴。","img":"images/645927/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}